5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must ensure the human element is secure. I shall look into staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am concerned about the actual purchasing power of these grants. I will check travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if the shared tools are actually working! I'll check incident logs on shared instrumentation and accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect hidden delays. I will examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I prefer empirical evidence of success. I will review closeout files of finished awards and national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
