25,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a surplus of coders but a drought of phenotyping technicians. The glasshouse crew, however, remains strong.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Computing is covered, but shipping costs are rising. Interestingly, the ministry is still subsidizing glasshouse space.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The spectroscopy suite was down for eleven weeks! But the animal facility is now fully accredited with vet cover.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Field sites are a gamble; flooding and fire caused total losses recently. Breeding colonies are also prone to schedule overruns.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Cataloging projects have lasting utility. Mechanism-focused studies often end without answering their primary questions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, that glasshouse subsidy is a blessing if the staff are still there.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Midori,,"It is, Servas. It seems the infrastructure for plant work is surprisingly stable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if breeding colonies are risky, maybe we should avoid the animal-heavy projects?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely, Kenji. The risk of biological delay is currently higher than the risk of computational failure.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. We should prioritize projects that produce a lasting resource over those chasing a single, elusive mechanism.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Servas,,I am worried about the lack of technicians for complex phenotyping. We must be careful.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, does that mean you favor a large-scale atlas over a specific molecular study?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm just glad the animal facility is accredited, but the spectroscopy failure is a huge red flag.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If the spectroscopy suite is unreliable, any project relying on it for timing is a liability.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"Yes, Midori. A catalog provides a foundation that survives even if the initial hypothesis is narrow.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us wait for the candidates to see which fits these realities.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Midori,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
