50,3,1,talk,Servas,,"We have the Atlas, Plant Signaling, Protein Folding, and Amphibian Regeneration. The Atlas seems safest regarding staffing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Midori,,Plant Signaling benefits from the glasshouse subsidy and the strong crew Servas mentioned.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Protein Folding needs spectroscopy, which I found is currently unreliable. I cannot support Candidate C.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Amphibians involve breeding colonies and animal rates are up. Candidate D is too risky.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Candidate A, the Microbiome Atlas, aligns with my finding that catalog-style awards have the best long-term impact.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, the Plant Signaling project is attractive, but does it require the phenotyping technicians we lack?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Midori,,"It might. The Atlas, however, relies more on sequencing and repository deposits.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"And the repository turnaround is now very fast, right Toshio?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, would the Atlas be more resilient to the field site disasters I saw?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Yes, as it aggregates samples across several zones; one site's failure won't kill the project.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Servas,,The Atlas is the most robust choice. It utilizes the available coding staff and the improved repository.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. It avoids the spectroscopy risks and the breeding colony delays.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm voting for the Atlas! It's the most positive path forward.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Logically, Candidate A has the fewest points of failure based on our findings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It is the most reliable investment.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Servas,,Then we are in harmony.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Midori,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
